      "text": "DNA SEQUENCE:     A T C G A T C G A T C G ...  (same in every cell)\n  EPIGENOME:        m   m     m       m           (methylation marks)\n                    ↑ acetyl ↑ methyl ↑           (histone modifications)\n                    [  open  ][closed][  open  ]  (chromatin state)"
